  "qid": "52",
  "tip": "<p>Match requirements for <i>lowest downtime</i> and <i>automatic failover</i> with high availability features. If the failure scope is a zone, prefer a regional HA configuration. Backups and point in time recovery are for restoration, and read replicas with manual promotion imply more downtime.</p>",
